{"doc_id": "csrc_0001_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0001_att1::c0134", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 15, "text": "第十七条规定\n的；", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": ["第十七条"]}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0001_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0001_att1::c0135", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 15, "text": "（四）私募基金管理人、私募基金托管人违反本办法第三十\n条、", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": []}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0001_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0001_att1::c0136", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 15, "text": "第三十一条规定，未建立信息披露管理制度的；", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": ["第三十一条"]}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0001_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0001_att1::c0137", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 15, "text": "（五）私募基金管理人、私募基金托管人违反本办法第三十\n三条", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": []}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0001_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0001_att1::c0138", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 15, "text": "第一款规定的；", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": []}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0001_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0001_att1::c0139", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 15, "text": "（六）私募基金销售机构及其他私募基金服务机构，以及前\n述机构的从业人员违反本办法", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": []}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0001_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0001_att1::c0140", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 15, "text": "第三十三条规定的；", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": ["第三十三条"]}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0001_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0001_att1::c0141", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 15, "text": "（七）中国证监会规定的其他情形。", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": []}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0001_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0001_att1::c0142", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 15, "text": "第七章 附 则", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": []}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0001_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0001_att1::c0143", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 15, "text": "第四十条 中国证监会对募集期间私募基金信息披露另有规\n定的，从其规定。\n15", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": ["第四十条"]}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0001_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0001_att1::c0144", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 16, "text": "第四十一条 符合中国证监会规定条件，将主要基金财产投\n资于其他私募基金的私募基金，法律、行政法规、中国证监会对\n其信息披露另有规定的，从其规定。", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": ["第四十一条"]}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0001_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0001_att1::c0145", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 16, "text": "第四十二条 本办法所称信息披露，是指私募基金管理人、\n私募基金托管人按照规定和约定，采用非公开方式向投资者提供\n私募基金信息。", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": ["第四十二条"]}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0001_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0001_att1::c0146", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 16, "text": "第四十三条 本办法所称私募基金，不包括证券期货经营机\n构依法设立的私募资产管理计划。", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": ["第四十三条"]}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0001_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0001_att1::c0147", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 16, "text": "第四十四条 本办法自 2026 年 9 月 1 日起施行。\n16", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": ["第四十四条"]}
